#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "NitroSearch for WooCommerce"
msgstr "NitroSearch for WooCommerce"


#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://nitrosearch.io"
msgstr "https://nitrosearch.io"


#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Blazing-fast hosted search for WooCommerce. Syncs your catalog to NitroSearch and replaces the default WordPress search with instant, typo-tolerant results."
msgstr "Pencarian super cepat yang di-hosting untuk WooCommerce. Menyinkronkan katalog Anda ke NitroSearch dan menggantikan pencarian bawaan WordPress dengan hasil instan yang toleran terhadap salah ketik."


#. Author of the plugin
msgid "WebDeviant"
msgstr "WebDeviant"


#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://webdeviant.io"
msgstr "https://webdeviant.io"


msgid "<strong>NitroSearch now measures how your store's search performs</strong> — anonymous, cookieless counts of searches and result clicks, with no shopper identifiers. It helps result ranking improve, and per-store reporting is on the roadmap."
msgstr "<strong>NitroSearch kini mengukur performa pencarian toko Anda</strong> — hitungan pencarian dan klik hasil yang anonim dan tanpa cookie, tanpa identitas pembeli. Ini membantu menyempurnakan peringkat hasil, dan pelaporan per toko ada dalam rencana pengembangan kami."


#. translators: %s: a link to the NitroSearch settings screen, labeled "NitroSearch → Appearance".
msgid "Manage it under %s."
msgstr "Kelola di %s."


msgid "NitroSearch → Appearance"
msgstr "NitroSearch → Tampilan"


msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "Abaikan"


msgid "Unauthorized."
msgstr "Tidak diizinkan."


msgid "Not connected"
msgstr "Belum terhubung"


msgid "Confirming control…"
msgstr "Mengonfirmasi kendali…"


msgid "Connected & verified"
msgstr "Terhubung & terverifikasi"


msgid "Amazon-quality search for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Pencarian sekelas Amazon untuk WooCommerce"


msgid "Connect your store"
msgstr "Hubungkan toko Anda"


msgid "Connect this store to NitroSearch to start syncing your catalog and serving instant, typo-tolerant search. Nothing leaves your site until you click Connect."
msgstr "Hubungkan toko ini ke NitroSearch untuk mulai menyinkronkan katalog Anda dan menyajikan pencarian instan yang toleran terhadap salah ketik. Tidak ada data yang keluar dari situs Anda sampai Anda mengeklik Hubungkan."


msgid "Provisioning token"
msgstr "Token provisioning"


msgid "Optional. Only needed if you were given a token to connect this store."
msgstr "Opsional. Hanya diperlukan jika Anda diberi token untuk menghubungkan toko ini."


msgid "Connect store"
msgstr "Hubungkan toko"


msgid "Confirming control of your site…"
msgstr "Mengonfirmasi kendali atas situs Anda…"


msgid "We’re verifying that you control this store before building your search index. In production this is automatic; if your site isn’t reachable from our servers it can take a moment. Your catalog syncs as soon as it’s confirmed."
msgstr "Kami sedang memverifikasi bahwa Anda mengendalikan toko ini sebelum membangun indeks pencarian Anda. Di lingkungan produksi proses ini otomatis; jika situs Anda tidak dapat dijangkau dari server kami, prosesnya bisa memakan waktu sebentar. Katalog Anda akan tersinkron begitu kendali terkonfirmasi."


msgid "Check status"
msgstr "Periksa status"


msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Putuskan sambungan"


msgid "Dashboard"
msgstr "Dasbor"


msgid "Design"
msgstr "Desain"


msgid "You’ve reached your plan’s limit."
msgstr "Anda telah mencapai batas paket Anda."


#. translators: %s: the "Manage / Upgrade" button label, wrapped in <em>. Translate it the same way as the button.
msgid "Your search keeps running for everything already indexed, but new items won’t be added until you upgrade. Your products always take priority, so anything held back is a page or a post. Open %s below to move to a bigger plan."
msgstr "Pencarian Anda tetap berjalan untuk semua yang sudah terindeks, tetapi item baru tidak akan ditambahkan sampai Anda meningkatkan paket. Produk Anda selalu diprioritaskan, jadi apa pun yang tertahan hanyalah halaman atau pos. Buka %s di bawah untuk beralih ke paket yang lebih besar."


msgid "Manage / Upgrade"
msgstr "Kelola / Tingkatkan"


msgid "Sync health"
msgstr "Kesehatan sinkronisasi"


msgid "Search results indexed"
msgstr "Hasil pencarian terindeks"


msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Tak terbatas"


msgid "Pending changes"
msgstr "Perubahan tertunda"


msgid "Last sync"
msgstr "Sinkronisasi terakhir"


msgid "Never"
msgstr "Belum pernah"


msgid "Last error"
msgstr "Kesalahan terakhir"


msgid "Sync all products"
msgstr "Sinkronkan semua produk"


msgid "Refresh status"
msgstr "Segarkan status"


#. translators: %s: a human-readable time interval, e.g. "4 mins".
msgid "%s from now"
msgstr "%s dari sekarang"


msgid "On demand"
msgstr "Sesuai permintaan"


msgctxt "unit: milliseconds"
msgid "ms"
msgstr "ms"


msgid "Sync performance"
msgstr "Performa sinkronisasi"


msgid "Avg sync speed"
msgstr "Kecepatan sinkronisasi rata-rata"


msgid "Last batch"
msgstr "Batch terakhir"


msgid "Items synced"
msgstr "Item tersinkron"


msgid "Batches sent"
msgstr "Batch terkirim"


msgid "Next sync"
msgstr "Sinkronisasi berikutnya"


msgid "Changes to your catalog are batched and pushed in the background — these figures show how quickly they reach your search index."
msgstr "Perubahan pada katalog Anda dikumpulkan per batch dan dikirim di latar belakang — angka-angka ini menunjukkan seberapa cepat perubahan itu mencapai indeks pencarian Anda."


msgid "Search analytics"
msgstr "Analitik pencarian"


msgid "last 30 days"
msgstr "30 hari terakhir"


msgid "Couldn’t load analytics just now — it will retry automatically."
msgstr "Analitik tidak dapat dimuat saat ini — akan dicoba ulang secara otomatis."


#. translators: 1: "N searches" (already localized), shown in bold. 2: the entry price of the cheapest paid plan (always billed in US dollars).
msgid "<strong>%1$s</strong> on your store in the last 30 days. See what shoppers searched for, what they clicked, and what they looked for and didn’t find — included on every paid plan, from %2$s."
msgstr "<strong>%1$s</strong> di toko Anda dalam 30 hari terakhir. Lihat apa yang dicari pembeli, apa yang mereka klik, dan apa yang mereka cari tetapi tidak ditemukan — termasuk dalam setiap paket berbayar, mulai dari %2$s."


#. translators: %s: number of searches.
msgid "%s search"
msgid_plural "%s searches"
msgstr[0] "%s pencarian"
msgstr[1] "%s pencarian"


#. translators: %s: a price in US dollars, e.g. "$5.99". "mo" is short for month.
msgid "%s/mo"
msgstr "%s/bln"


msgid "Upgrade to unlock"
msgstr "Tingkatkan paket untuk membuka"


msgid "Analytics starts collecting with plugin 1.5.0+ active — data appears within a few hours of shoppers searching."
msgstr "Analitik mulai mengumpulkan data ketika plugin 1.5.0+ aktif — data muncul dalam beberapa jam setelah pembeli mulai mencari."


msgid "Searches"
msgstr "Pencarian"


msgid "Zero-result rate"
msgstr "Tingkat tanpa hasil"


msgid "Click-through"
msgstr "Klik-tayang"


msgid "Top searches"
msgstr "Pencarian teratas"


msgid "Searched, found nothing"
msgstr "Dicari, tanpa hasil"


msgid "View full analytics →"
msgstr "Lihat analitik lengkap →"


msgid "Your plan & account"
msgstr "Paket & akun Anda"


msgid "This store is claimed to a NitroSearch account. Manage your plan and billing from your NitroSearch dashboard."
msgstr "Toko ini telah diklaim ke sebuah akun NitroSearch. Kelola paket dan tagihan Anda dari dasbor NitroSearch Anda."


msgid "You're on the <strong>Free</strong> plan. Claim this store to a NitroSearch account to manage it or upgrade — your index and search stay exactly as they are."
msgstr "Anda menggunakan paket <strong>Gratis</strong>. Klaim toko ini ke sebuah akun NitroSearch untuk mengelola atau meningkatkan paketnya — indeks dan pencarian Anda tetap persis seperti sekarang."


msgid "Roomy"
msgstr "Lega"


msgid "Two-line names and a clear picture. The default."
msgstr "Nama dua baris dan gambar yang jelas. Pilihan bawaan."


msgid "Compact"
msgstr "Ringkas"


msgid "Smaller rows, so more products fit before scrolling."
msgstr "Baris lebih kecil, sehingga lebih banyak produk muat sebelum menggulir."


msgid "Big pictures"
msgstr "Gambar besar"


msgid "Larger thumbnails for image-led catalogs."
msgstr "Thumbnail lebih besar untuk katalog yang mengandalkan gambar."


msgid "Text only"
msgstr "Hanya teks"


msgid "No pictures — good for spare parts and B2B."
msgstr "Tanpa gambar — cocok untuk suku cadang, komponen, dan B2B."


msgid "Light"
msgstr "Terang"


msgid "A white panel. Suits most themes."
msgstr "Panel putih. Cocok untuk sebagian besar tema."


msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Gelap"


msgid "A dark panel, for dark headers and themes."
msgstr "Panel gelap, untuk header dan tema gelap."


msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Otomatis"


msgid "Follows each shopper's own device setting."
msgstr "Mengikuti pengaturan perangkat masing-masing pembeli."


msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Kustom"


msgid "Choose your own panel and text colors below."
msgstr "Pilih sendiri warna panel dan teks Anda di bawah."


msgid "Look"
msgstr "Gaya"


msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Tata letak"


msgid "Products shown"
msgstr "Produk yang ditampilkan"


msgid "How many products appear in the drop-down as your shopper types."
msgstr "Jumlah produk yang muncul di panel tarik-turun saat pembeli Anda mengetik."


msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Filter"


msgid "Automatic (recommended)"
msgstr "Otomatis (disarankan)"


msgid "Always across the top"
msgstr "Selalu di bagian atas"


msgid "Hide in the drop-down"
msgstr "Sembunyikan di panel tarik-turun"


msgid "In stock, on sale, brand and category filters. Automatic puts them in a side column when there is room, and across the top when there is not."
msgstr "Filter stok tersedia, sedang diskon, merek, dan kategori. Pilihan Otomatis menempatkannya di kolom samping saat ruangnya cukup, dan di bagian atas saat tidak."


msgid "Drop-down width"
msgstr "Lebar panel tarik-turun"


msgid "Wide"
msgstr "Lebar"


msgid "Match my search box"
msgstr "Sesuaikan dengan kotak pencarian saya"


msgid "Automatic gives product names enough room to read, even when your theme's search box is narrow. Match my search box keeps it exactly as wide as the box."
msgstr "Pilihan Otomatis memberi nama produk ruang yang cukup agar mudah dibaca, bahkan saat kotak pencarian tema Anda sempit. Pilihan Sesuaikan dengan kotak pencarian saya menjaga lebarnya persis sama dengan kotak tersebut."


msgid "Colors"
msgstr "Warna"


msgid "Color scheme"
msgstr "Skema warna"


msgid "Accent color"
msgstr "Warna aksen"


msgid "Used for prices, highlights and selected filters. Leave blank for the default. Text on top of it is set to black or white automatically, whichever stays readable."
msgstr "Digunakan untuk harga, sorotan, dan filter yang dipilih. Biarkan kosong untuk warna bawaan. Teks di atasnya diatur menjadi hitam atau putih secara otomatis, mana pun yang tetap terbaca."


msgid "Panel background"
msgstr "Latar belakang panel"


msgid "Only used when the color scheme is set to Custom."
msgstr "Hanya digunakan saat skema warna diatur ke Kustom."


msgid "Text color"
msgstr "Warna teks"


msgid "Corners"
msgstr "Sudut"


msgid "Rounded"
msgstr "Membulat"


msgid "Slightly rounded"
msgstr "Sedikit membulat"


msgid "Square"
msgstr "Siku"


msgid "Text style"
msgstr "Gaya teks"


msgid "Match my store"
msgstr "Sesuaikan dengan toko saya"


msgid "System default"
msgstr "Bawaan sistem"


msgid "Custom font"
msgstr "Font kustom"


msgid "Match my store borrows the font your theme already uses around the search box."
msgstr "Pilihan Sesuaikan dengan toko saya meminjam font yang sudah digunakan tema Anda di sekitar kotak pencarian."


msgctxt "example font stack"
msgid "e.g. Georgia, serif"
msgstr "mis. Georgia, serif"


msgid "Only used when Custom font is selected."
msgstr "Hanya digunakan saat Font kustom dipilih."


msgid "What to search"
msgstr "Apa yang dicari"


msgid "Include"
msgstr "Sertakan"


msgid "Products"
msgstr "Produk"


msgid "always indexed"
msgstr "selalu diindeks"


msgid "Pages"
msgstr "Halaman"


msgid "Blog posts"
msgstr "Pos blog"


#. translators: %s: the technical term "noindex", wrapped in <em>. Do not translate it.
msgid "Pages and posts count toward the same allowance as your products, so switching them off frees it up for your catalog. Your products always come first and are never displaced by them. Private, password-protected and unpublished content is never indexed, and we honor %s set by Yoast SEO or Rank Math (per item, per content type, or site-wide)."
msgstr "Halaman dan pos dihitung dalam jatah yang sama dengan produk Anda, jadi menonaktifkannya akan membebaskan jatah untuk katalog Anda. Produk Anda selalu diutamakan dan tidak pernah tergeser oleh keduanya. Konten privat, yang dilindungi kata sandi, dan yang belum diterbitkan tidak pernah diindeks, dan kami menghormati %s yang diatur oleh Yoast SEO atau Rank Math (per item, per jenis konten, atau untuk seluruh situs)."


msgid "Search results page"
msgstr "Halaman hasil pencarian"


msgid "Enhance the product search results page with NitroSearch results and filters"
msgstr "Sempurnakan halaman hasil pencarian produk dengan hasil dan filter NitroSearch"


msgid "Privacy &amp; credit"
msgstr "Privasi &amp; kredit"


msgid "Search usage data"
msgstr "Data penggunaan pencarian"


msgid "Share anonymous search usage counts with NitroSearch"
msgstr "Bagikan hitungan penggunaan pencarian anonim dengan NitroSearch"


msgid "Counts searches, result totals and result clicks on your store's search — cookieless and anonymous, with no shopper identifiers, no IP addresses and nothing stored in the shopper's browser. Used to improve result ranking and to power your search analytics. Uncheck to stop sending immediately."
msgstr "Menghitung pencarian, jumlah hasil, dan klik hasil pada pencarian di toko Anda — tanpa cookie dan anonim, tanpa identitas pembeli, tanpa alamat IP, dan tidak ada yang disimpan di peramban pembeli. Digunakan untuk menyempurnakan peringkat hasil dan menjalankan analitik pencarian Anda. Hapus centang untuk langsung berhenti mengirim."


msgid "Powered-by credit"
msgstr "Kredit “Didukung oleh”"


msgid "Show a small “Powered by NitroSearch” credit, linking to nitrosearch.io"
msgstr "Tampilkan kredit kecil “Didukung oleh NitroSearch” yang tertaut ke nitrosearch.io"


#. translators: %s: the URL https://nitrosearch.io, wrapped in <code>.
msgid "Off by default, and entirely your choice. Turning it on adds a small credit in the search box and one line in your site footer, both linking to %s — a normal, followed link. Nothing is added to your site unless you check this. Thank you if you do."
msgstr "Nonaktif secara bawaan, dan sepenuhnya pilihan Anda. Mengaktifkannya menambahkan kredit kecil di kotak pencarian dan satu baris di footer situs Anda, keduanya tertaut ke %s — tautan biasa tanpa atribut nofollow. Tidak ada yang ditambahkan ke situs Anda kecuali Anda mencentang ini. Terima kasih jika Anda mengaktifkannya."


msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Lanjutan"


msgid "Search box selector"
msgstr "Selektor kotak pencarian"


msgctxt "example CSS selector"
msgid "e.g. input.my-theme-search"
msgstr "mis. input.my-theme-search"


msgid "Optional CSS selector for your theme's search input. Leave blank to auto-detect."
msgstr "Selektor CSS opsional untuk input pencarian tema Anda. Biarkan kosong untuk deteksi otomatis."


msgid "Save design"
msgstr "Simpan desain"


#. translators: %s: the error detail returned by the server.
msgid "Connect failed: %s"
msgstr "Gagal menghubungkan: %s"


msgid "unknown error"
msgstr "kesalahan tak dikenal"


msgid "Connected and verified."
msgstr "Terhubung dan terverifikasi."


msgid "Connected. Confirming control of your site — this can take a moment. Use “Check status” below if it doesn’t update."
msgstr "Terhubung. Sedang mengonfirmasi kendali atas situs Anda — ini bisa memakan waktu sebentar. Gunakan “Periksa status” di bawah jika statusnya tidak kunjung diperbarui."


#. translators: %s: number of products.
msgid "Syncing %s product in the background, then your pages and posts."
msgid_plural "Syncing %s products in the background, then your pages and posts."
msgstr[0] "Menyinkronkan %s produk di latar belakang, lalu halaman dan pos Anda."
msgstr[1] "Menyinkronkan %s produk di latar belakang, lalu halaman dan pos Anda."


#. translators: %s: number of products.
msgid "Syncing %s product in the background."
msgid_plural "Syncing %s products in the background."
msgstr[0] "Menyinkronkan %s produk di latar belakang."
msgstr[1] "Menyinkronkan %s produk di latar belakang."


msgid "Verified!"
msgstr "Terverifikasi!"


#. translators: 1: number of items in the search index, 2: number of changes waiting to sync.
msgid "%1$s search results indexed · %2$s pending."
msgstr "%1$s hasil pencarian terindeks · %2$s tertunda."


msgid "Still confirming control of your site — please try again in a moment."
msgstr "Masih mengonfirmasi kendali atas situs Anda — silakan coba lagi sebentar lagi."


msgid "Design saved."
msgstr "Desain disimpan."


msgid "Saved. Removing your pages and blog posts from your index in the background."
msgstr "Disimpan. Menghapus halaman dan pos blog Anda dari indeks di latar belakang."


msgid "Saved. Removing your pages from your index in the background."
msgstr "Disimpan. Menghapus halaman Anda dari indeks di latar belakang."


